    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"f0d24cf6-a001-446e-8938-587a798ef55e\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Forms 2.0</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>The sections below are only relevant for Forms 2.0, available since v0.90</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><h2>Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"il\">Form</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"il\">builder</span>&nbsp;is part of the Implementer Interface toolset and can be used by the implementers to easily design&nbsp;<span class=\"il\">forms</span>&nbsp;via an interface. This tool seeks to simplify the current process of creating a JSON configuration to control the behavior of concepts could be handled through the&nbsp;<span class=\"il\">form</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"il\">builder</span>.</p><p><strong>NOTE:</strong>The Form Builder Control Panel Page shows 50 forms by default. To increase the limit, Go to OpenMRS&gt;Advanced Settings and change the value of `webservices.rest.maxResultsDefault` to an appropriate value.Keep in mind that this will also affect areas such as number of patients retrieved in the registration page,number of active patients etc</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"02926166-ff18-449c-a136-d88ab5ebc88f\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Support For Observation Data Capture in Form Builder</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085295/Add+Controls#https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085295/Add+Controls#AddControls-SupportedControls\">Supported Controls</a>&nbsp;</li><li><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085295/Add+Controls#AddControls-ControlsandbehaviournotyetsupportedinForms2.0\">Not yet supported Controls</a></li></ul></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2>Video Overview of Form Builder</h2><p>Please also checkout these videos on <strong>Form Builder 2.0</strong>:</p><ol class=\"ak-ol\"><li><p>Part1: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WPOdBFg5Df0\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WPOdBFg5Df0</a></p></li><li><p>Part2: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iW35PxG1Iwc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iW35PxG1Iwc</a></p></li><li><p>Part3: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j4kEvs-iSgk\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j4kEvs-iSgk</a></p></li><li>New Features:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hRuIQQX7R8o\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hRuIQQX7R8o</a></li></ol><h2><ac:image ac:title=\"Form Builder v2.0\" ac:alt=\"Form Builder v2.0\" ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2023-9-29_10-33-20.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></h2><h2>Sections</h2><p>Please refer to these sections to use Form Builder</p><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" ac:macro-id=\"be65a977-d824-4d49-9045-8267ecd4c308\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"all\">true</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p><p><em><br /></em></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"c3d94ba2-f500-405f-8f14-ae8d6bcb7293\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">On this Page</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"6edbaf1d-ba21-455a-8a7f-11e55df98e35\" /></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"f5e76242-9ad1-477e-9fa2-70ff0a12c473\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Feature Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Implementer's Interface\" ri:version-at-save=\"4\" /></ac:link></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
