    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f0d24cf6-a001-446e-8938-587a798ef55e\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Forms 2.0</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>The sections below are only relevant for Forms 2.0, available since v0.90</p></div></div><h2 id=\"FormBuilder-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"il\">Form</span> <span class=\"il\">builder</span> is part of the Implementer Interface toolset and can be used by the implementers to easily design <span class=\"il\">forms</span> via an interface. This tool seeks to simplify the current process of creating a JSON configuration to control the behavior of concepts could be handled through the <span class=\"il\">form</span> <span class=\"il\">builder</span>.</p><p><strong>NOTE:</strong>The Form Builder Control Panel Page shows 50 forms by default. To increase the limit, Go to OpenMRS&gt;Advanced Settings and change the value of `webservices.rest.maxResultsDefault` to an appropriate value.Keep in mind that this will also affect areas such as number of patients retrieved in the registration page,number of active patients etc</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"02926166-ff18-449c-a136-d88ab5ebc88f\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Support For Observation Data Capture in Form Builder</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085295/Add+Controls#https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085295/Add+Controls#AddControls-SupportedControls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supported Controls</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085295/Add+Controls#AddControls-ControlsandbehaviournotyetsupportedinForms2.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Not yet supported Controls</a></li></ul></div></div><h2 id=\"FormBuilder-VideoOverviewofFormBuilder\">Video Overview of Form Builder</h2><p>Please also checkout these videos on <strong>Form Builder 2.0</strong>:</p><ol class=\"ak-ol\"><li><p>Part1: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WPOdBFg5Df0\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WPOdBFg5Df0</a></p></li><li><p>Part2: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iW35PxG1Iwc\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iW35PxG1Iwc</a></p></li><li><p>Part3: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j4kEvs-iSgk\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j4kEvs-iSgk</a></p></li><li>New Features: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hRuIQQX7R8o\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hRuIQQX7R8o</a></li></ol><h2 id=\"FormBuilder-\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" alt=\"Form Builder v2.0\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/100565092/image2023-9-29_10-33-20.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1695963802232&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=503&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/100565092/image2023-9-29_10-33-20.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1695963802232&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3233939457\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2023-9-29_10-33-20.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"100565092\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"26\" data-media-id=\"d18b2d14-76a2-4b7d-9100-0da6be2ea521\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Form Builder v2.0\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/100565092/image2023-9-29_10-33-20.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1695963802232&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1006&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/100565092/image2023-9-29_10-33-20.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1695963802232&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=503&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></h2><h2 id=\"FormBuilder-Sections\">Sections</h2><p>Please refer to these sections to use Form Builder</p><p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"be65a977-d824-4d49-9045-8267ecd4c308\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085295/Add+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115085295\" data-linked-resource-version=\"16\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Add Controls</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085335/Edit+a+Published+Form\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115085335\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Edit a Published Form</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085378/Rename+a+Form\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115085378\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Rename a Form</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/237338635/Form+Builder+Internationalization\" data-linked-resource-id=\"237338635\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Form Builder Internationalization</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/239796253/Import+Export\" data-linked-resource-id=\"239796253\" data-linked-resource-version=\"14\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Import &amp; Export</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/237437004/Form+Conditions+Form+Events\" data-linked-resource-id=\"237437004\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Form Conditions / Form Events</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/2318893296/Single+editor+for+form+event+and+control+event\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2318893296\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Single editor for form event and control event</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/2306539867/API+to+display+form+builder+forms+forms+2.0+for+a+patient+in+dashboard\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2306539867\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">API to display form builder forms(forms 2.0) for a patient in dashboard</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/2318893278/Copy+the+translations+of+form+2.0+from+one+version+to+the+next+version+in+implementer-interface\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2318893278\" data-linked-resource-version=\"3\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Copy the translations of form (2.0) from one version to the next version in implementer-interface</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/2435710977/Preview+the+form2+form+before+publishing+in+Implementer+interface\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2435710977\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Preview the form2 form before publishing in Implementer interface</a></li></ul></p><p><em><br/></em></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c3d94ba2-f500-405f-8f14-ae8d6bcb7293\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui